==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*bez}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*bʰeǵʰ-}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/bʲes/|lang=ru}}
* {{audio|Ru-без.ogg|audio|lang=ru}}
* Homophones: [[бес]]

===Preposition===
'''без''' (bez, ''+ [[genitive case]]''), [[безо]] (bézo, ''before some awkward consonant clusters'')

# [[without]]
#:* {{lang|ru|без [[вода|воды́]]}} — ''without water''
#:* {{lang|ru|бе́зо [[весь|всего́]]}} — ''without anything''
#:* {{lang|ru|не без [[интерес|интере́са]]}} — ''not without interest''
#:* {{lang|ru|без [[сомнение|сомне́ния]]}} — ''without doubt''
# [[minus]]
#:* {{lang|ru|без [[четверть|че́тверти]] [[час]]}} — ''a quarter to one'' (lit., less a quarter one o’clock)

====Related terms====
* [[без-]]

